    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Benhadad Oo Weeraray Samaariya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Benhadad oo ahaa boqorkii Suuriya wuxuu soo urursaday ciidankiisii oo dhan, waxaana isaga la jiray laba iyo soddon boqor, iyo fardo iyo gaadhifardood; oo intuu soo kacay ayuu Samaariya hareereeyey, wuuna la diriray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu magaaladii farriin u diray oo wuxuu boqorkii dalka Israa'iil oo Axaab ahaa ku yidhi, Anigoo Benhadad ah, waxaan kugu leeyahay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacagtaada iyo dahabkaaga anigaa iska leh, oo naagahaaga, iyo carruurtaada, xataa kuwa ugu fiican anigaa iska leh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii dalka Israa'iil ugu jawaabay, Boqorow, sayidkaygiiyow, waa sidaad u tidhi, oo aniga iyo waxayga oo dhanba adigaa iska leh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wargeeyayaashii haddana way soo noqdeen oo waxay yidhaahdeen, Benhadad wuxuu kugu leeyahay, Xaqiiqa waan ku soo cid diray oo waxaan kugu idhi, Waa inaad ii soo dhiibto lacagtaada, iyo dahabkaaga, iyo naagahaaga, iyo carruurtaadaba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiinse berrito hadda oo kale waxaan kuu soo diri doonaa addoommadayda, oo waxay soo baadhi doonaan gurigaaga iyo guryaha addoommadaadaba, oo wax alla wixii kula wanaagsan gacantooday ku dhigi doonaan, wayna kaa soo qaadi doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii dalka Israa'iil u soo yeedhay odayaashii dalka oo dhan, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Waan idin baryayaaye, bal eega oo ogaada sida ninkanu iiga belaayo doonayo, waayo, wuxuu u soo cid dirsaday naagahayga iyo carruurtayda, iyo lacagtayda, iyo dahabkayga, oo anna uma aanan diidin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa odayaashii oo dhan iyo dadkii oo dhammu waxay isagii ku yidhaahdeen, Ha dhegaysan, hana oggolaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed wuxuu ku yidhi kuwii Benhadad warka ka keenay, Boqorka sayidkayga ah u sheega oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaan, Dhammaan wixii aad markii hore ii soo dirsatay anoo addoonkaaga ah, waan yeelayaa, laakiinse waxan yeeli kari maayo. Oo wargeeyayaashiina way ka tageen, oo haddana war kalay u keeneen isagii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benhadad baa u soo cid diray oo ku yidhi, Sidaas iyo si ka sii daranba ilaahyadu ha igu sameeyeen haddii ciidda Samaariya sacab sacab u gaadho dadka ila socda oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii dalka Israa'iil wuxuu ugu jawaabay, U sheega oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaan, Ka hubka dagaalka xidhaa yuusan u faanin sidii midka iska fura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markii Benhadad farriintii maqlay, isagoo khamri teendhooyinka kula cabbaya boqorradii ayuu addoommadiisii ku yidhi, War weerar isu diyaariya. Oo iyana markaasay magaaladii weerar isugu diyaariyeen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Axaab Oo Ka Adkaaday Benhadad",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo bal eeg, nebi baa u soo dhowaaday boqorkii dalka Israa'iil oo Axaab ahaa, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, War Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Dadkan faraha badan oo dhan ma aragtay? Bal ogow, kulligood adigaan maanta kuu soo gacangelinayaa, oo markaasaad ogaan doontaa inaan anigu ahay Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Axaab wuxuu yidhi, Oo yuu iigu soo gacangelinayaa? Isna wuxuu yidhi, Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Amiirradii gobollada addoommadooda ayaan kuugu soo gacangelinayaa. Oo haddana wuxuu yidhi, Oo dagaalka yaa bilaabaya? Wuxuu yidhi, Adiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu tiriyey amiirradii gobollada addoommadooda, oo waxay ahaayeen laba boqol iyo laba iyo soddon; oo dabadoodna wuxuu tiriyey dadkii oo dhan, oo dadkii dalka Israa'iil oo dhammu waxay noqdeen toddoba kun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo duhurkii ayay baxeen. Laakiinse Benhadad khamri buu cabbayay oo teendhooyinkii ku sakhraamayay, isaga iyo boqorradii la jirayba, kuwaasoo ahaa laba iyo soddonkii boqor oo isaga caawinayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa markii hore soo baxay amiirradii gobollada addoommadoodii; oo Benhadadna cid buu diray, oo waxaa loo soo sheegay oo lagu yidhi, Rag baa Samaariya ka soo baxay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isna wuxuu yidhi, Hadday nabad u soo baxeen iyo hadday dagaal u soo baxeenba iyagoo nool qabqabta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed kuwanu magaaladii way ka soo baxeen, waxayna ahaayeen amiirradii gobollada addoommadoodii iyo ciidankii iyaga daba socday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kulligood mid waluba ninkiisii ayuu dilay; markaasaa ciidanka Suuriya cararay, oo ciidankii Israa'iilna way eryadeen; oo Benhadad oo ahaa boqorkii Suuriya faras buu fuulay oo rag fardooley ah la baxsaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii dalka Israa'iil baxay oo baabbi'iyey fardihii iyo gaadhifardoodkii, oo ciidankii Suuriyana aad buu u laayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa nebigii u soo dhowaaday boqorkii dalka Israa'iil oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Tag oo soo xoogayso, oo bal ogow, oo eeg waxaad samaynaysid, waayo, markii sannaddu soo wareegto ayaa boqorka Suuriya kugu soo duuli doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo boqorkii Suuriya addoommadiisii waxay isagii ku yidhaahdeen, War ilaahoodu waa ilaahii buuraha oo sidaas daraaddeed ayay inooga xoog bateen. Haddaba aynu bannaanka kula dirirno oo markaas hubaal waynu ka xoog badnaanaynaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad yeeshaa, boqorrada nin walba meeshiisii ka saar, oo meeshoodii waxaad gelisaa taliyayaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad tirsataa ciidan le'eg ciidankii kaa le'day, oo faras kasta meeshiisii faras geli, gaadhifaras kastana meeshiisii gaadhifaras geli; oo markaasaynu iyaga bannaanka kula diriraynaa, oo hubaal waynu ka adkaanaynaa, oo isna codkoodii buu maqlay oo saasuu yeelay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii sannaddii soo wareegtay ayaa Benhadad tiriyey ciidankii Suuriya, oo intuu Afeeq tegey ayuu la diriray ciidankii Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo ciidankii Israa'iilna waa la tiriyey, oo saadkoodiina waa la siiyey, markaasay iyagii ka hor tageen; oo ciidankii Israa'iilna hortooday degeen iyagoo la moodo sidii laba xaymood oo yaryar oo waxarro ah, laakiinse ciidankii Suuriya dalkoo dhan bay buuxiyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii dalka Israa'iil waxaa u yimid oo la hadlay nin Ilaah, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Rabbigu wuxuu kugu leeyahay, Reer Suuriya waxay yidhaahdeen, Rabbigu waa Ilaahii buuraha, laakiinse ma aha Ilaahii dooxooyinka, oo sidaas daraaddeed dadkan faraha badan oo dhan adigaan ku soo gacangelinayaa, oo markaasaad ogaan doontaan inaan anigu ahay Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intii toddoba maalmood ah ayay is-hor degganaayeen. Oo waxay noqotay in maalintii toddobaad dagaalkii bilaabmay, oo maalin keliya ayaa ciidankii Israa'iil waxay dadkii Suuriya ka laayeen boqol kun oo nin oo lug ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse intoodii kale Afeeq ayay u carareen oo magaaladay galeen, oo toddoba iyo labaatan kun oo nin oo ka hadhayna waxaa ku soo dhacay derbigii. Markaasaa Benhadad cararay oo magaaladuu galay isagoo ugu gudbaya qol ilaa qol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo addoommadiisii waxay ku yidhaahdeen, Bal eeg, waxaannu maqalnay in boqorrada dalka Israa'iil yihiin boqorro naxariis badan, haddaba waannu ku baryaynaaye aannu joonyado guntanno, oo madaxana aannu xadhko ku duudduubanno, oo aannu boqorka dalka Israa'iil u baxno, waxaa laga yaabaa inuu naftaada badbaadiyee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed waxay guntadeen joonyado, madaxyadana waxay ku duudduubteen xadhko, oo waxay u yimaadeen boqorkii dalka Israa'iil, oo ku yidhaahdeen, Addoonkaagii Benhadad wuxuu kugu leeyahay, Waan ku baryayaaye maanta i bixi. Oo isna wuxuu ku yidhi, War miyuu weli nool yahay? Isagu waa walaalkay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo nimankiina aad bay ugu dadaaleen inay calaamad wanaagsan ka maqlaan, oo waxay ku dhaqsadeen inay qabsadaan in taasu maankiisa ku jirto iyo in kale, kolkaasay waxay ku yidhaahdeen, Benhadad waa walaalkaa. Isna wuxuu yidhi, Taga oo ii keena. Markaasaa Benhadad isagii u soo baxay, oo isna gaadhifaraskiisii ayuu soo fuushiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Benhadad wuxuu ku yidhi, Waan kuu celinayaa magaalooyinkii aabbahay aabbahaa ka dhacay, oo waxaad Dimishaq ka samaysataa jidad sidii aabbahay Samaariya uga samaystay oo kale. Axaabna wuxuu ku yidhi, Axdiganaan kugu sii daynayaa. Sidaasuu axdi ula dhigtay, wuuna iska sii daayay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nebi Baa Xukumay Axaab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo nin qoonkii nebiyada ka mid ah ayaa saaxiibkiis ku yidhi, War i dil, waan ku baryayaaye, taasuna waxay ahayd eray xagga Rabbiga ka yimid, laakiinse ninkii waa diiday inuu dilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasuu ku yidhi, Adigu ma aadan addeecin Eraygii Rabbiga oo sidaas daraaddeed bal ogow haddiiba markii aad iga tagto waxaa ku dili doona libaax. Oo haddiiba markuu isagii ka tegey ayaa waxaa helay libaax, wuuna dilay isagii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana wuxuu helay nin kale, markaasuu ku yidhi, War waan ku baryayaaye i dil. Markaasaa ninkii intuu wax ku dhuftay dhaawacay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa nebigii tegey oo boqorkii ku sugay jidka agtiisa, wuuna isku beddelay calalkiisii madaxa oo uu indhaha ku qariyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii boqorkii soo ag maray ayuu boqorkii u qayliyey, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Anigoo addoonkaaga ahu waxaan dhex galay dagaalkii, oo bal eeg nin baa igu soo leexday, nin buuna ii keenay, oo wuxuu igu yidhi, Ninkan dhawr; oo si kastaba ha noqotee haddii hadhow la waayo, naftaadaa loo qisaasayaa, ama haddii kaleto waxaad bixin doontaa talanti lacag ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo anigoo addoonkaaga ah intii aan mashquul ku ahaa halkan iyo halkaas ayaa ninkii iska tegey. Markaasaa boqorkii dalka Israa'iil ku yidhi, Xukunkaagu saasuu ahaanayaa, waayo, adaa goostay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu dhaqsaday oo calalkiina indhihii ka qaaday, boqorkiina wuu gartay inuu isagu qoonkii nebiyada ka mid ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu isagii ku yidhi, Rabbigu wuxuu ku leeyahay, Ninkii aan baabba'a ku xukumay ayaad gacantaada ka sii daysay, oo sidaas daraaddeed naftaadu waxay u dhiman doontaa naftiisa, dadkaaguna dadkiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii dalka Israa'iil wuxuu u kacay gurigiisii isagoo calool xun, oo xanaaqsan, oo Samaariya buu yimid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
